As others have noted, there is no penalty for carrying the Book. What 
you want, though, after dispatching Rodney for the first time, is speed. 
Best method is to have a means of teleport control, a cursed scroll of 
teleport, and some other means of ordinary (within level) teleport.

On the first turn after retrieving the book, read the scroll of 
levelport, and port down to the VS level. On the second turn, port over 
to the VS. Two turns after retrieving the Book, you're ready for the 
invocation.

> The Priest of Moloch died noisily and dishonorably, leaving the final prize 
